  "title": "Data for Canada - Foundation Data Packages",
  "description": "Standardized foundation data packages for Canada, including the National Address Register (multiple snapshots from 2024\u20132025) and the 2021 road network, sourced from Statistics Canada. Records are enriched with a full hierarchy of StatCan geographic identifiers (province, census division, CSD, CMA, etc.) and distributed in high-performance formats (Parquet, FlatGeobuf, PMTiles) for use in geospatial software and analytical pipelines.",
